jobs_results.description:
Net Developer - +8 years of experience
• Apply CI/CD (continuous integration and continuous deployment) and testing practices;
• Development of Client/Server, Multi-Tier web solutions;
• Development using web front-end technologies;
• Development of database connected applications;
• Integration development between disparate systems;
• Drafting technical specification documentation;
• Gathering requirements from users and communicating technical aspects to non-technical individuals;
• Contributing to the development of training material and user guides.

The following is a description of the technologies already in place as well as the future ones to be deployed:
• User Environment/Platform:
• Windows 10;
• Office tools: Microsoft Office 2016 & O365. MS Teams, MS Internet Explorer v11, EDGE, Chrome, Adobe Acrobat Professional;
• Systems
• Backend Infrastructure: Windows Server 2016 R2 (on Premise) / Azure (Cloud);
• Databases:
• On-Premise: SQL Server 2014 / Oracle 19c ;
• Cloud... Azure SQL DB / SQL Managed Instance.
• Active Directory, DNS Server, DHCP Server, File Server, Print Server;
• Email Server: Microsoft Exchange 2019 / Exchange online.
• Application frameworks and business intelligence:
• Microsoft .Net framework (all available versions) and .Net Core;
• ASPNET all available versions (including Core);
• EF (all available version including Core);
• Modern web development frameworks like: Angular , Automapper, jquery, bootstrap, TypeScript Visual Studio, Git';
• Modern web development tools like: less, gulp, npm, nugget, bower;
• Testing frameworks such as MSUnit, MoqU, Fakes, qunit , Selenium;
• Performance Testing framework (e.g. JMeter);
• Microsoft Sharepoint 2007/2010/2013;
• Oracle WebLogic Server 11g/12c;
• Azure Devops Server (CI/CD);
• Agile, SCRUM Methodologies for Software development;
• Docker, Azure Container Service

